,"title":"About this book","text":"<p>The first volume of the Śrīkara Bhāṣya, the Vīraśaiva (Śaktiviśiṣṭādvaita) commentary on the Brahma-sūtras, with Hayavadana Rao’s long introduction on the Vīraśaiva faith (Bangalore, 1936). Listed in the catalogue of the Rare Book Society of India.</p> <p>From Internet Archive · Public domain in India</p><p>Scanned and hosted by the Internet Archive. Item: The Srikara Bhashya Introduction Vol. I 1936 C. Hayavadana Rao · eGangotri, 955 scanned pages. Published 1936; C. Hayavadana Rao died 1946; the commentary is medieval; public domain in India.</p><p>This book is not stored in this library: its pages are shown from the Internet Archive when they are opened, in this library's own viewer, and each chapter ends with this credit. The pages are shown as scans in this library's viewer (zoom, pan, thumbnails); the machine reading of these scans is not good enough to be shown as text. The item on the Internet Archive (opened only if you click it).</p>"},{"location":"rare-books/srikara-bhashya-1/pages-1-25.html","title":"Pages 1–25","text":""},{"location":"rare-books/srikara-bhashya-1/pages-101-125.html","title":"Pages 101–125","text":""},{"location":"rare-books/srikara-bhashya-1/pages-126-150.html","title":"Pages 126–150","text":""},{"location":"rare-books/srikara-bhashya-1/pages-151-175.html","title":"Pages 151–175","text":""},{"location":"rare-books/srikara-bhashya-1/pages-176-200.html","title":"Pages 176–200","text":""},{"location":"rare-books/srikara-bhashya-1/pages-201-225.html","title":"Pages 201–225","text":""},{"location":"rare-books/srikara-bhashya-1/pages-226-250.html","title":"Pages 226–250","text":""},{"location":"rare-books/srikara-bhashya-1/pages-251-275.html","title":"Pages 251–275","text":""},{"location":"rare-books/srikara-bhashya-1/pages-26-50.html","title":"Pages 26–50","text":""},{"location":"rare-books/srikara-bhashya-1/pages-276-300.html","title":"Pages 276–300","text":""},{"location":"rare-books/srikara-bhashya-1/